<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:orcl="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Control;assembly=OpenRigs.Control"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>The training stage, the same in every task: the experiment parameter TrainingStage as it stood at Go (ParameterValue on ExperimentGo), the stage's code as text (S00A: position in its training path from S00, then the path's letter), as the AsyncSubject TrainingStage, and reported to the controller as the metric trainingStage. The workflow declares the parameter TrainingStage on ExperimentControl; after ExperimentControl, whose ExperimentGo it reads.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>ExperimentGo</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ParameterValue">
          <orcl:Name>TrainingStage</orcl:Name>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
        <Name>TrainingStage</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
          <orcl:Name>trainingStage</orcl:Name>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
